                <head>International sanitary convention</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Paris December 3, 1903.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate March 1, 1905. Ratified by the President
                        of the United States August 2, 1905. Ratifications deposited with the
                        Government of the French Republic April 6, 1907. Proclaimed May 18,
                        1907.</hi></p>

